  <text x="605" y="385" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#42505e">jamin kapasitas AZ, bukan diskon</text>

  <rect x="120" y="420" width="580" height="40" rx="10" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="135" y="438" text-anchor="start" font-size="11" fill="#42505e">Spot &amp; On-Demand = bayar saat pakai. RI &amp; Savings Plans = diskon komitmen (BUKAN hardware).</text>
  <text x="135" y="453" text-anchor="start" font-size="11" fill="#42505e">Dedicated Hosts = isolasi fisik + lisensi. Capacity Reservation = jaminan kapasitas, harga tetap On-Demand.</text>
